## 3.13 `Simon/ml/features.py`

### Exact purpose

**Extended 42-dimensional feature vector** (when all groups enabled) for autoencoder input.

### Technical mechanics and code logic

**`bit_transitions`.** Counts 0→1 and 1→0 transitions along 32-bit MSB-first vector per block.

